                        <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-3">
                            <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 bg-slate-50/50 p-3 rounded-xl">
                                <span class="font-bold text-indigo-600 text-sm min-w-[24px]">A:</span>
                                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Which of these jackets do you like more?</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 bg-indigo-50/40 p-3 rounded-xl border border-indigo-100/50">
