                                    It's 
                                    <input type="text" id="g-c2-2" placeholder="(attractive)" class="grammar-input mx-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 focus:border-violet-500 focus:outline-none w-36 text-center font-bold text-violet-700 text-sm bg-white">
                                    than the brown and orange one.
                                </div>
