                                    than the gold ones. And they're 
                                    <input type="text" id="g-c3-2" placeholder="(cheap)" class="grammar-input mx-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border-2 border-slate-300 focus:border-violet-500 focus:outline-none w-28 text-center font-bold text-violet-700 text-sm bg-white">.
