                    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-display">Fashion Boutique Roleplay</h2>
                    <p class="text-emerald-100 text-sm">
                        Practice asking and answering preferences with a partner or using speech synthesis!
                    </p>
