                            <li class="flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-600 text-[10px] mr-2"></i> "The design is nicer."</li>
                            <li class="flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-600 text-[10px] mr-2"></i> "The style is more attractive."</li>
                            <li class="flex items-center"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-amber-600 text-[10px] mr-2"></i> "The material is better."</li>
